    "directory listing off. Those are held to no-worse-than-dead, not to fixed.",
    "",
    "Add a URL here when a release or an external document publishes one. Never remove",
    "one: removing one is exactly the regression this file exists to catch.",
    "",
    "The four fonts/*/OFL.txt paths carry no inbound link. They are recorded because",
